## Stack map (this repo — not the Starblast/NGO tutorial)

| Concept | Titan Orbit |
|---------|-------------|
| Tick / fixed dt | NetCode predicted fixed step (~60 Hz); not variable `Time.deltaTime` for motor |
| Local prediction | `ShipClientPredictedPhysicsDriveSystem` + shared `ShipPhysicsDriveLogic` |
| Server authority | `ShipPhysicsDriveSystem` (same math) |
| Remotes | Ghost interpolation (presentation pose) — sphere resolve writes the local hull only |
| Reconciliation | NetCode rollback/resim + prediction smoothing — not a hand-rolled NGO circular buffer as the primary path |
| Visuals | Presentation pose / cache → camera & hull render — **no** custom `Update` MoveTowards toward sim for the owner |

**Forbidden for flight feel work:** NGO `NetworkBehaviour` / `NetworkVariable` motor paths; JSON payloads; allocating in the tick loop; reading raw sim for local camera when presentation exists.

